{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "14", "m": "09", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "09", "M": "20", "S": "03"}}, "news": [{"title": "Andhra Pradesh government to set up special cell to clear hurdles to high-rise building plans", "para": "The state government is enhancing the approval process for tall buildings by establishing a specialized unit for applications pertaining to structures with five or more floors. This initiative seeks to expedite review timelines and minimize holdups for developers. Authorities are tasked with addressing existing software issues and promoting transparency. These reforms are designed to invigorate the construction and real estate sectors statewide.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/andhra-pradesh-government-to-set-up-special-cell-to-clear-hurdles-to-high-rise-building-plans/134232357?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-145390/134232357.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Convert B khata to A until end of 2027: Karnataka government", "para": "Karnataka government has authorized the conversion of eligible 'B' Khata properties to 'A' Khata. This new mechanism will be implemented by urban and rural development departments until December 2027. Properties up to 1,000 square meters with proposed non-agricultural use are covered by this order. Specific cut-off dates apply for properties in urban and rural local bodies respectively.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/convert-b-khata-to-a-until-end-of-2027-karnataka-government/134232340?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-108054/134232340.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Housing project in Haryana\u2019s Sultanpur park buffer zone seeks fresh wildlife clearance", "para": "A developer is pursuing